ks are pre-engineered and contractor-grade, and do not require a professional crew for installation. After seeing how much value a well-built outdoor space adds to a home and how unnecessarily complicated the traditional way to build a deck can be, we engineered a better system.<\/p><h3><strong>40% <br\/>Less Than Contractor Pricing<\/strong><\/h3><p>Our direct-to-homeowner model cuts out the middleman. You get the same professional-grade materials and structural engineering without paying for someone else's labor markup.<\/p><h3><strong>1 Day<br\/>Average Assembly Time<\/strong><\/h3><p>Every board is pre-cut, pre-drilled, and labeled to a numbered assembly diagram. We've had customers wrap a full 12×16 deck by midday with no prior building experience.<\/p><h3><\/h3>","first_text_class":"custom-text-style","first_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/a-diy-decks-are-pre-engineered.png","second_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Modern_RV_Deck.webp","second_richtext":"<h3><strong>5 Years<br\/>Full Product Warranty<\/strong><\/h3><p>Every A-DIY deck kit ships with a 5-year warranty covering materials and structural integrity. If something doesn't perform as engineered, we make it right for you.<\/p><h3><strong>USA<br\/>Manufactured Here. Every Kit.<\/strong><\/h3><p>Every board, bracket, and fastener is sourced and processed domestically. Domestic production means tighter quality control, faster shipping, and consistency you can count on.<\/p><p><\/p>","second_text_class":"custom-text-style"}},"two_column_media_text_button_QNgL7U":{"type":"two-column-media-text-button","name":"Two Column Section Button","settings":{"section_heading":"Choose the Deck Surface That Fits Your Life.","heading_class":"none","heading_richtext":"<p>Both materials are professional-grade. The right choice comes down to your climate, maintenance preferences, and the look you want.<\/p>","heading_richtext_class":"none","section_bg_color":"#ffffff","left_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/pressure-treated-kiln-dried-wood-deck-kit-719820.jpg","left_content":"<h3><strong>Pressure Treated<br\/>Kiln-Dried After Treatment (KDAT) <\/strong><\/h3><p><\/p><p>✓ Kiln-dried after treatment prevents warping, shrinking, and cracking.<\/p><p>✓ Exceptional structural strength for platform and elevated builds.<\/p><p>✓ Takes paint or stain when you're ready to personalize the finish.<\/p><p>✓ Industry-leading value.<\/p><p>✓ Natural wood grain and feel underfoot.<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p>","left_content_class":"Rich-Text","left_button_text":"Shop Pressure Treated Kits","left_button_link":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/products\/pressure-treated-kiln-dried-wood-deck-kit","left_button_class":"button-secondary","right_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/a-diy-composite-deck-kit-879850.jpg","right_content":"<h3>Composite<br\/>Wood aesthetics with all-weather and long-term performance.<\/h3><p><br\/>✓ Fade-resistant, splinter-free surface that holds its color.<\/p><p>✓ Won't warp, rot, or crack even through freeze cycles.<\/p><p>✓ Cleans with soap and water.<\/p><p>✓ Safe for bare feet, kids, and pets in all seasons.<\/p><p>✓ Stylish wood grain look without the wood maintenance.<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p>","right_content_class":"none","right_button_text":"Composite Deck Kits","right_button_link":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/products\/a-diy-composite-deck-kit","right_button_class":"button-secondary"}},"content_grid_Kc4fn6":{"type":"content-grid","blocks":{"layout_flex_jnbgQN":{"type":"layout__flex","settings":{"flex_direction_align_x_align_y_gap_wrap":"column | left | center|","padding_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","border_width_radius":"0 | 0","background_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","border_color":"","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"48\/0 | 48\/36 | 0 | 24\/0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"464px\/100% | unset | 2 | unset | inherit","responsive_visibility":"","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"richtext_PzNbp4":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"title":"<h2><strong>5,000+ Decks Built and Loved<br\/>